 contains fewer distances than expected. I wrote down the pattern of reeds beside a drain, the sound of a loose board, and a disagreement about whether a distant chimney belonged to the mill or the bakery. By the return journey, everyone had adopted a different theory. We ended at the covered market, where somebody produced a thermos and somebody else discovered that an apparently waterproof map was not waterproof at all. Next week we will bring a larger map case and leave more time for the pumping house.","token_ids":[42563,1681,19710,24263,1523,3355,1010,12783,1058,1278,20466,3549,1317,1278,1759,7347,10066,1321,2595,1010,51286,1058,18168,1513,1278,3030,1044,2430,1261,8455,26062,1307,61561,26527,1267,4268,14533,2203,2295,5200,1513,1278,7537,40506,3147,4631,3306,7135,2142,1317,49674,1278,3992,66978,5718,1046,3730,1486,1836,15232,1317,14776,2158,1046,23312,2274,15477,17277,3979,1261,97470,28454,1513,1278,15077,19826,2862,1044,1321,1278,3067,1307,1650,16533,2015,25644,1278,10066,121823,1681,73953,1626,6720,51810,8688,25671,29145,2224,6878,1046,1362,9956,3151,1278,5965,1307,103427,25644,1261,24942,1044,1278,7759,1307,1261,33430,9710,1044,1321,1261,83867,2314,5627,1261,30594,29171,5284,43530,1317,1278,4246,1505,1278,26597,3093,1046,5652,1278,1850,24061,1044,12787,1880,18230,1261,2801,9191,1046,2837,13955,1513,1278,13875,7232,1044,2478,41159,8077,1261,9976,1346,1321,41159,2849,16757,1455,1420,22312,4180,65708,6373,1486,1605,4180,65708,1513,1747,1046,18147,4819,1729,2084,8548,1261,9039,6373,2937,1321,9288,2081,2142,1394,1278,66978,5718,1046],"tokens":["Today","'s","Ġwalking","-cl","ub","Ġlog","Ċ","Route",":","Ġthe","Ġcanal","Ġpath","Ġto","Ġthe","Ġdis","used","Ġlock","Ġand","Ġback","Ċ","Weather",":","Ġbright","Ġat","Ġthe","Ġstart",",","Ġthen","Ġa","Ġslow","Ġarrival","Ġof","Ġdri","zzle","ĊĊ","We","Ġdivided","Ġinto","Ġtwo","Ġgroups","Ġat","Ġthe","Ġfoot","bridge","Ġbecause","Ġseveral","Ġpeople","Ġwanted","Ġtime","Ġto","Ġsketch","Ġthe","Ġold","Ġpumping","Ġhouse",".","ĠThere","