ra sotava na dredre ena nodra vakavakarau kina sotasota ni Wellington Sevens ena vula tarava.\nIa, ena nona lesu mai ki Viti, e kidacalataka o Serevi ni qai mai kila ka ratou sega ni bau vakaraitaka mada vua, na i lawalawa vakailesilesi era sa digitaka oti tu na timi me na la’ki qito ki Wellington. Na kena ca, ni sa mani veivosakitaki oti tu me na vakatarogi ena retio yaloyalo ena vuku ni kena veitalanoataki na kacivaki ni yaca.\nOqo saraga nai tekitekivu ni dua na delana levu e sotava ena nona dauniveivakatavulici ena vuku ni kena sega ni rogoci na veika e laveta cake mai vei ira na tiko ena vale kau vulavula ena gauna oya.\nE vola nai vola, ena nona gauna taucoko ni qito e dau qarauna sara o Serevi me kakua ni vakayalolailaitaka e dua ena kena rogoci na nona itukutuku.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-fj-0057","collection":"dataset/fineweb/fj.jsonl","text":"28A sa sereka na gusu ni asa ko Jiova, ka sa vosa kina na asa vei Pelami, ka kaya A cava ka'u sa cakava vei iko, ko sa yaviti au vakatolu kina? 29A sa kaya vua na asa ko Pelami, Ni ko sa vakalialiai au: ke dua mada nai seleiwau e ligaqu, au sa qai vakamatei iko. 30A sa kaya vei Pelami na asa, Oi au na nomu asa se segai, ka ko sa dauvodoki au e na nomu bula taucoko ka yacova na siga oqo; au a daukitaka beka vakaoqo vei iko? A sa kaya ko koya, E segai. 31A sa qai vakamataraitaki Pelami ko Jiova, a sa kunea ko koya, ni sa tu e na sala na agilose i Jiova, a sa taura tu e ligana na nonai seleiwau: a sa cuva vakatoboicu. 32A sa kaya vua ko koya na agilose i Jiova, A cava ko sa yavita vakatolu kina na nomu asa? raica, ka'u a lako mai me'u tataro, ni sa lako vakatani na nomu i valavala vei au: 33a sa kunei au na asa, ka gole tani kina vakatolu vei au: kevaka sa sega ni gole tani vei au, ka'u sa vakamatei iko oti vakaidina, ka vakabulai koya, 34A sa kaya vua na agilose i Jiova ko Pelami, Au sai valavala ca; ka'u a sega ni kila ni kemuni a tu e na sala me tarovi au: ia oqo, kevaka sa ca vei kemuni, ka'u na lesu tale.","token_ids":[1050,1056,1065,1887,1265,1441,3002,2336,1343,30226,6512,1435,1097,7047,24378,7187,1044,8614,1887,1330,5615,1409,2208,2336,1435,1097,2597,1105,24826,7345,1044,8614,1409,8302,1349,1272,2245,8614,40439,1887,1272,1489,2245,2597,1105,1032,8003,1044,7047,1887,1404,1430,6770,1817,1330,25940,23198,1409,2208,1063,1032,1050,1057,1065,1887,1409,8302,60849,2336,1435,1097,7047,24826,7345,1044,17671,7047,1887,54053,1279,1551,19806,1817,1058,2371,35844,1283,2045,2336,1105,19144,1105,56308,1324,35072,1348,1044,1817,1887,4367,2464,54053,48452,1105,1032,8003,1046,1032,1051,1048,1065,1887,1409,8302,2597,1105,24826,7345,2336,1435,1097,1044,1535,1105,1817,2336,5146,1117,1435,1097,1412,3939,2464,1044,8614,7047,1887,55845,21569,23572,1817,1324,2336,5146,1117,1289,4427,1257,10758,14895,8614,1404,1413,7187,2336,1265,5560,1281,1113,1111,1059,1817,1261,55845,19094,10100,1402,3002,54053,4975,1113,1111,2597,1105,1032,8003,1063,1349,1887,1409,8302,7047,1409,31312,1044,1436,3939,2464,1046,1032,1051,1049,1065,1887,4367,2464,54053,1325,10242,1861,10004,24826,7345,7047,24378,7187,1044,1261,1887,1409,50590,7047,1409,31312,1044,6512,1887,4487,1324,2336,27509,2336,1984,1318,1842,1623,24378,7187,1044,1261,1887,7535,3099,4487,1324,7215,3088,2336,2767,2464,19144,1105,56308,1058,1261,1887,3376,2940,1330,25940,35879,60969,1046,1032,1051,1050,1065,1887,1409,8302,60849,7047,1409,31312,2336,1984,1318,1842,1623,24378,7187,1044,1349,1272,2245,7047,1887,1404,1430,3537,1330,25940,23198,1409,2208,2336,5146,1117,1435,1097,1063,2093,2459,1044,8614,40439,1261,1427,3505,7538,1639,40439,51941,9234,1044,6512,1887,1427,3505,1330,25940,6724,2336,5146,1117,1623,1916,1430,4182,2597,1105,1817,1058,1032,1051,1051,1097,1887,1409,2471,1105,1817,2336,1435,1097,1044,8614,69013,1257,6724,1409,2208,1330,25940,23198,2597,1105,1817,1058,123517,10100,1887,1412,3577,6512,69013,1257,6724,2597,1105,1817,1044,8614,40439,1887,54053,48452,1105,1032,8003,1281,4464,1330,