o INC pegua.\nKo guarani mbo’esyry rupive hi’ã oñe’ẽ ha ohai porãve guaraníme mba’apoharakuéra, tetã ñe’ẽ teeháicha, ha péicha tove toñeñangareko porãve mayma tetãyguárare ha iñe’ẽ derécho tove toñembojerovia.\nOjehekombo’e guaraníme tetã mba’apohárape ojeguatávo Léi 4251/10 ári, he’iháicha Art. 17-pe, he’ihápe tetã mba’apohára oikuaava’erãha mokõive ñe’ẽ tee.\nPÑS guive, omoirũ sãmbyhyhárape Ypykuéra Ñe’ẽita Ñeñongatu ha Ñemoasãi moakãharapavẽ, Rossana Bogado de Orué; Ñe’ẽ Rapereka moakãharapavẽ, Celeste Fleitas Girland; Gabinete moakãhára, María Benigna Alvarenga de Sánchez; Tecnologías de la Información y Comunicación moakãhára, Raúl Felipe Galeano Jiménez.","token_ids":[77767,123721,6724,1492,1177,1101,1471,22026,8780,2363,16899,128394,2357,32328,1662,4037,15636,13557,1446,1343,1204,1131,14020,2113,4895,88246,2113,105299,1311,2813,24156,53246,1671,69685,1319,96422,1041,1265,2113,1109,3326,16713,1104,21663,1044,22885,3031,1871,4526,1558,1044,1390,1195,1145,1083,1492,1177,2003,83137,1118,4013,1804,1046,109876,28458,1032,1049,1048,1048,17080,2518,3944,91112,15287,1829,1032,1053,1057,1283,4402,23873,2523,21663,7047,128394,28183,4037,1626,77767,123721,6724,1283,2363,21718,1121,1938,119765,1556,14994,1471,2113,1281,2624,1101,1471,22026,3944,12447,2464,2173,2113,1672,3003,12845,1529,1804,1283,4402,23873,2523,1277,19179,13557,1044,15049,2113,1492,1177,1101,1471,22026,1777,12687,1502,36252,1044,3944,28556,36252,1317,1672,1317,2624,1101,2624,1533,1667,3505,2173,2113,1672,2188,1831,15049,126549,3394,21663,1273,3944,1623,2624,1101,1471,22026,1728,1337,2630,1317,1672,1317,2624,2094,3659,1258,51873,1626,1079,2548,1268,8780,2363,16899,3003,12845,1529,1804,15049,2113,1283,4402,23873,2523,21663,1446,1281,46376,29084,1502,2518,44261,1105,1032,1052,1050,1053,1049,1047,1049,1048,4324,1444,1044,1514,1471,4183,1502,36252,6009,1046,1032,1049,1055,1045,1446,1044,1514,1471,4183,1502,1446,15049,2113,1283,4402,23873,2523,21663,1281,1552,4037,2245,98343,2113,3230,72335,4013,1556,1492,1177,