na, nā lālā o ka hui, nā mea kōkua o waho a me nā mea kūʻai aku i kahi ala seamless kahi pilikia maoli.\nAkā ʻaʻole ʻo ka hoʻohui ʻana i ka poʻe ka hopena o ka moʻolelo. I mea e alakaʻi ai i kahi papahana me kahi kahe kūpono, pono ʻoe i kahi ala intuitive no ka kaʻana like ʻana i nā manaʻo hou, ka laulima ʻana ma o ka workflow, ka hōʻike ʻana, a me nā mea hou aku.\nLawe kēia iā mākou i ka hopena ʻaʻole maʻalahi ka hana ʻana i ke kaulike ma ka papahana no nā alakaʻi. Inā ʻoe e holo nei i kahi ʻoihana kūʻai aku, alakaʻi i kahi hui o nā hoʻolālā a i ʻole nā mea hoʻomohala, a i ʻole inā ʻike wale ʻoe i kahi hoʻomaka me kekahi mau hoaaloha - inā ʻaʻole ʻoe e hoʻohana ana i kahi mea hana hoʻokele papahana, he kuhi hewa nui paha ia.","token_ids":[6102,1065,6102,2561,1310,7857,1623,8614,1285,4547,1324,1310,7857,7538,30304,2371,4744,6102,8153,6102,4322,125281,1623,1409,8547,1485,8614,20910,1626,1080,6489,1283,4547,29408,124902,1112,1786,1324,4744,6102,130845,2523,4037,1639,60684,1283,4547,29408,5796,3414,1261,1310,4547,6102,45809,1623,8614,1639,1097,1914,4822,125281,1324,1310,3088,1274,10095,1623,1308,4547,1409,1721,1046,1032,6102,1079,19806,1308,4547,4962,1816,3088,1324,1308,97238,4547,1914,6102,13450,1105,1623,8614,1032,6102,2150,95243,1044,1310,7857,2371,47660,1261,4431,6102,1489,1552,7701,1046,1032,6102,1079,8614,4744,6102,1263,2523,1263,53260,1032,6102,3088,1623,1308,4547,1310,3088,1044,1308,4547,1295,68179,4547,1281,8614,1310,2386,1044,1308,4547,1639,1097,1409,16096,71855,1281,1285,52730,1261,1639,1308,4547,1639,1097,1409,10095,6102,2464,1261,4106,1623,56163,1105,72821,129775,56163,1105,9290,88717,1914,8153,1626,70745,4547,1032,6102,1097,6102,2561,1032,6102,1111,8614,4744,6102,2523,2386,1032,6102,3088,1623,8614,2001,6102,1101,8614,11638,3414,1281,8614,3498,6102,2561,1906,1046,1362,1639,1097,1324,1410,10100,125281,10160,1623,56163,1105,4962,1816,3088,1639,56163,1105,8614,1268,1409,10095,1812,1111,1044,1274,6489,1032,6102,16122,1623,56163,1105,72821,66168,1836,8614,8614,