ine, a cilj nam je da svaki gost bude svime zadovoljan. Inače, gosti traže nesebično gostoprimstvo, toplinu, komunikaciju, sigurnost, kvalitetnu domaću hranu, udoban smještaj. Do sada smo ugošćavali i engleske vegetarijance, od kojih jedan meso nije okusio više od 25 godina. Kad mu je moj muž Ante ponudio dalmatinski pršut, engleski turist nije mogao izdržati. Nakon što je zagrizao, jeo je koliko god je želio i mogao, zatim mu je godilo i naše crno vino. Priznao je kako je, zahvaljujući pršutu, prekršio sve vegetarijalna pravila», priča gospođa Marija.","token_ids":[3443,46035,1329,10538,1653,32254,1343,17042,1044,43894,1412,1333,80464,1356,11037,3723,16721,21265,5202,127117,2317,24893,1044,35816,86544,5517,1044,16961,24618,15650,1623,1330,1983,1282,1412,1653,14852,2649,1333,1836,3723,1044,1261,11452,1100,2548,1470,4961,6596,2513,1965,1044,7689,2649,1602,2310,1046,8206,17247,92520,1344,19307,38713,1412,11452,1100,2548,14634,2548,3122,2548,3723,15650,1044,3909,7306,15650,1412,1653,30181,2870,2548,1046,16715,1108,22811,2336,4961,2186,31620,1965,1257,1549,2001,16202,25972,14619,1623,11452,13129,1412,6459,10004,3920,14705,3723,15650,26950,2514,1258,1044,22044,8060,1623,46974,1539,59696,2729,1046,6978,37962,11037,26991,7127,113119,1272,6684,1282,20701,1044,1261,30474,1106,10538,2310,2170,6459,10004,62335,68899,6459,1721,46974,1539,1336,12742,1046,1656,1097,19139,1044,1343,17042,2072,12518,1308,1983,8283,49779,62335,1484,10489,26687,1044,40770,12505,1044,53370,66410,1044,5703,1645,1591,1044,41211,13410,8096,93182,47835,67726,1117,1044,10519,1724,1271,2710,103783,1046,5469,1265,2045,15314,1333,2762,106872,1430,4077,1623,4119,2013,1965,16238,1859,1106,1741,1044,3909,127053,62774,4619,1111,34542,5913,1374,1655,39912,3909,1032,1050,1053,54236,1046,42330,3849,2310,3498,1106,84275,74447,11931,9383,5442,7238,45884,1517,2381,1341,1044,4119,2013,3757,121438,34542,16747,4975,4961,15894,2546,3888,1046,79608,23446,2310,38827,1444,2712,1111,1044,2310,1111,2310,13589,8003,9007,2310,910