{"id":"fineweb-ig-0006","collection":"dataset/fineweb/ig.jsonl","text":"N'ezie, nraranye omenala nke orcs na onye a dị omimi bụ na Arondir na ọtụtụ ndị ọzọ elves ndị a kpọchiri n'ogige Adar na-eche ma aha ya nwere ike ịbụ okwu ọzọ maka Sauron. Ọ na-arụsi ọrụ ike n'ịhazi nnukwu netwọkụ nke ọwara mmiri dị n'okpuru ala gafee Southlands na ibibi obodo nta mmadụ ọ bụla na-aga n'ụzọ ya. Anyị nwere ike ọ gaghị ama nwoke a n'ihu ọha, mana ọ dị ka ihe doro anya na ọ bụ onye ọjọọ, yana onye nwere ụdị ọrụ gbara ọchịchịrị nke a na-ekpughebeghị.\nMgbe mbọ mgbapụ agbapụ gachara nke ọma, a dọkpụrụ Arondir gaa Adar, mana naanị ntakịrị ntakịrị ihe anyị hụrụ gbasara ọnụ ọgụgụ a ka nwere nnukwu anya. Ọ gaghị ekwe omume ikwu nke agbụrụ Adar bụ n'oge nkenke oge anyị na-ahụ ihu ya, naanị na ọ bụ icha mmirimmiri na kama ogologo ntutu isi ojii. Mana ọ dị ka ihe doro anya na ma ọ bụ mmadụ ma ọ bụ ụdị elf rụrụ arụ, ọ bụghị onye orc.","token_ids":[1078,11424,7718,1044,1308,12951,106699,1281,2976,4182,1308,1965,1505,10359,2336,1408,6857,1261,1266,8010,4895,9923,1289,9372,2336,2194,2234,1378,2336,1032,8149,1116,9372,1116,9372,23940,8010,1032,8149,1122,8149,117840,23940,8010,1261,1409,1112,8149,1331,11667,1308,1039,1500,3832,3567,1277,2336,7058,1837,1914,1261,3230,6957,1308,73151,1032,2150,1032,8010,1098,9372,5913,123679,1032,8149,1122,8149,80525,7474,58359,1046,63249,1140,2336,31736,9372,5822,1032,8149,1114,9372,1032,2150,1308,1039,8010,1104,15589,35504,2699,123679,4274,1119,8149,1107,9372,1308,1965,1032,8149,96356,5724,11667,1266,8010,1308,1039,1662,1112,20836,72821,17019,68585,6443,7963,2336,13604,20399,1843,8740,1308,2083,5724,1332,9372,1032,8149,1289,9372,2584,2336,1045,9820,1308,1039,9372,1122,8149,6957,1046,11623,8010,1308,73151,1032,2150,1032,8149,1343,49107,8010,39635,1308,1119,6611,1261,1308,1039,4183,1117,1032,8149,3230,1044,43650,1032,8149,1266,8010,8614,1623,1268,1266,7402,2258,1097,2336,1032,8149,1289,9372,1408,6857,1032,8149,1106,8149,8149,1044,86410,1408,6857,1308,73151,1032,9372