ands na ibibi obodo nta mmadụ ọ bụla na-aga n'ụzọ ya. Anyị nwere ike ọ gaghị ama nwoke a n'ihu ọha, mana ọ dị ka ihe doro anya na ọ bụ onye ọjọọ, yana onye nwere ụdị ọrụ gbara ọchịchịrị nke a na-ekpughebeghị.\nMgbe mbọ mgbapụ agbapụ gachara nke ọma, a dọkpụrụ Arondir gaa Adar, mana naanị ntakịrị ntakịrị ihe anyị hụrụ gbasara ọnụ ọgụgụ a ka nwere nnukwu anya. Ọ gaghị ekwe omume ikwu nke agbụrụ Adar bụ n'oge nkenke oge anyị na-ahụ ihu ya, naanị na ọ bụ icha mmirimmiri na kama ogologo ntutu isi ojii. Mana ọ dị ka ihe doro anya na ma ọ bụ mmadụ ma ọ bụ ụdị elf rụrụ arụ, ọ bụghị onye orc.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-ig-0066","collection":"dataset/fineweb/ig.jsonl","text":"Enwere ọtụtụ ihe omimi karịa mgbe ha si n'oké osimiri bịa. Ebe ụfọdụ n’ụwa nwere ọmarịcha ihe okike nke a na-agbakwunye na ngwa anya anya nke na-eju ndị niile bịara leta ya anya. Taa, anyị ga-ekwu maka ya Fata Morgana utịp. Mmetụta a pụtara n'ụsọ ụfọdụ ma mee ka onye ọ bụla nwee ike iji anya nke uche hụ ya ikwu okwu.\nN’isiokwu a anyị ga-agwa gị ihe Fata Morgana na-arụ na ihe kpatara ya.\nKedu ihe bụ fata Morgana\nAha nke mmetụta a sitere n'akụkọ ifo nke Eze Arthur. Ọ bụ agwa ochie na akwụkwọ ndị Europe. Eze Arthur nwere ọkara nwanne nwanyị bụ nwanyị mgbaasị nke ikike ya bụ ịgbanwe ọdịdị ya. A maara nzọụkwụ ahụ aha Morgana le Fay, Morgane, Morganna, Morgaine na aha ndị ọzọ. Aha ọ bụla ọ bụ, amaara ya dị ka onye anwansi ma ọ bụ nwanyị mgbaasị nwere ikike anwansi.","token_ids":[2911,73151,1032,8149,1116,9372,1116,9372,1623,1268,4895,9923,8626,114001,9597,2352,3944,2445,1308,1039,1662,1337,3122,1329,11667,15688,1097,1046,1436,2352,1032,9372,1102,8149,1100,9372,1308,1471,9372,4761,1308,73151,1032,8149,7306,8010,4202,1623,1268,5913,2150,1308,1965,1261,2336,124257,108817,1119,1384,6857,2336,4684,4761,2258,1097,2258,1097,1308,1965,2336,7058,5517,23940,8010,6512,1631,15688,2912,31757,6957,2258,1097,1046,15264,1097,1044,2258,8010,17019,92684,123