a kai tuuturu tiro he pai ki te kai totika.\nKo te wero ka tae mai i muri i te paetae o to taumaha whaainga ka hiahia koe ki te hoki ki te kai i waho, te whakarite i o kai, ki te kai kai tuuturu ranei. Ko nga kaitautohe o te kai e kii ana i te wa o te hotaka, kaore koe e akohia me pehea te hoko taonga, te hanga, me te whakarite i nga kai totika pai. Ma te punaha tuku kai e mahi katoa maau.\nMe whakamatau au i te Nutrisystem Diet?\nMena kei te hiahia koe ki te whakaheke i te taumaha, kaore koe e aro ki te kai kai takai me te kai whakatotoka, ana kaore he nui o te waa ki te tunu kai me te whakareri i a koe ake kai, katahi ka hiahia pea koe ki te tirotiro i tenei huarahi poto.\nMena he pai ki a koe te kai i nga whenua maha, kaare e taea te whai i te Nutrisystem.\nE hia nga utu mo te Nutrisystem me pehea te mahi?\nKo te kaupapa $ 300 mo te marama o te kai.","token_ids":[59277,1464,8374,1111,3377,15264,1403,13090,1362,3377,48028,42610,6224,2037,9551,9510,6582,61158,2135,1097,1044,94408,1046,2182,115604,120220,3002,1777,74398,3888,1623,1777,115604,1044,2336,8614,4684,9234,1777,7535,1403,13090,1281,1261,2093,1633,1117,30750,1441,115604,1777,6582,61158,1281,26372,115604,4487,1341,20836,53020,1514,35986,8518,1777,115604,3212,4822,1626,77767,1777,1285,3168,8614,7535,1101,7538,1623,8423,1105,1623,1777,4431,3662,1101,1281,1317,7535,1403,13090,1452,17498,61158,8614,1310,33151,1485,7047,1101,8518,1777,1310,23572,8518,1777,115604,1623,1285,52730,1044,1777,1452,66487,1752,1623,1281,115604,1044,8518,1777,115604,115604,4487,1341,20836,1382,2868,1105,1046,15352,26372,1409,1861,11668,1268,1281,1777,115604,1324,1409,4743,30304,1623,1777,8411,1281,1777,8480,10100,1044,8614,1557,7047,1101,1324,8839,2523,1485,1639,2135,42001,1777,1310,14895,7535,44184,1044,1777,16018,1097,1044,1639,1777,1452,66487,1752,1623,26372,115604,3212,4822,35986,1046,5682,1777,6764,13090,1257,28458,115604,1324,30750,1105,1409,2696,1097,1914,1786,1626,9180,1452,1489,1325,1633,1117,1817,1623,1777,42610,6224,2037,33626