alam pancasila yaitu sila kalimo.\nAdaik bacupak bagantang sangaik arek kaitannyo dengan pamimpin. pamimpin di Minangkabau disabuik “urang nan ampek jinih”, yaitu pangulu, manti, malin, dan dubalang. Dari kaampek ko kito baraja mana tau kito manjadi salah satu nyo. Kito hiduik dalam bamasyarakaik tantu punyo pamimpin. Misalnyo apobilo kito manjadi pamimpin di Minangkabau tantunyo kito mampunyoi cupak tasandiri dalam diri kito cupak iko nan paratamu tantunyo cupak usali yaitu cupak yang didasarkan pado diri kito maksudnyo hati kito, kama kato hati itulah nan sabananyo.","token_ids":[108120,56163,1327,57460,14429,1859,5352,1859,1044,124279,11576,8636,33151,3920,104075,15018,1816,7345,1429,28065,33151,8471,42413,11553,1450,80804,4135,1098,3614,1034,3920,1429,26571,1533,8471,42413,11553,1450,80804,68517,1034,20949,11553,1450,80804,3642,1533,23972,1046,36509,89712,7172,7047,12537,1117,68674,29944,2696,1271,2495,1489,1683,1485,1044,8626,3112,2495,1489,1265,80418,2464,5552,69694,1586,2371,1332,35567,71060,11576,7007,19179,10735,5452,16014,10100,1552,5101,1533,1046,12697,7172,1032,8003,28711,11626,113459,5552,36140,1552,11576,51571,1982,1489,11772,1450,1533,59496,107576,11576,7007,1421,20866,69694,1586,2371,1332,35567,42870,5452,16014,10100,1552,11576,3250,78559,1533,10735,81391,1288,5691,59496,5043,1097,17145,6248,1626,1065,3190,1552,51571,1982,1489,11772,1450,1533,10981,1097,1552,1584,1107,1409,1861,1980,13504,8757,33816,69214,1046,33816,69214,1772,5101,51736,1401,1786,1759,76029,1552,2129,1328,1533,11576,1855,49134,1475,3598,1104,10226,59496,81211,18403,1044,1283,7680,1044,4773,1259,1044,3920,22338,1279,1533,1046,101419,8614,1325,49134,7047,1409,3424,4266,9950,43650,41158,1409,3424,117772,3614,58673,27319,9714,1111,1046,1550,3424,21364,1117,1552,10735,1289,1325,13699,1277,10100,1552,12537,1117,6764,13504,33816,69214,1046,40716,1279,3491,1111,2073,1724,9790,1409,3424,117772,3614,33816,69214,1772,5101,51736,1401,1786,12537,1384,13504,1409,3424,98923,72437,5317,19339,1489,2