," par","at","amu"," tant","un","yo"," cup","ak"," us","ali"," yaitu"," cup","ak"," yang"," did","as","arkan"," p","ado"," diri"," k","ito"," maks","ud","ny","o"," h","ati"," k","ito",","," k","ama"," k","ato"," h","ati"," it","ul","ah"," nan"," s","aban","any","o","."],"ids_available":true,"boundaries_approximate":false,"piece_format":"native_vocabulary_piece","decoded_text":"Dalam kahidupan sahari-hari, arti nan labiah dan kurang dipahami \"labiah untuak kapantingan pribadi\" dan \"kurang untuak kapantingan umum\" atau kapantingan urang lain. Istilah mode ko tantu bisa dikatoan indak adia, karano indak sasuai jo prinsip keadilan sosial nan balaku dalam masyarakaik Minang. Hal mode iko babeda berbeda jo adaik nan bacupak bagantang yaitu asas nan balandasan prinsip keadilan bagi masyarakaik nan takanduang dalam pancasila yaitu sila kalimo.\nAdaik bacupak bagantang sangaik arek kaitannyo dengan pamimpin. pamimpin di Minangkabau disabuik “urang nan ampek jinih”, yaitu pangulu, manti, malin, dan dubalang. Dari kaampek ko kito baraja mana tau kito manjadi salah satu nyo. Kito hiduik dalam bamasyarakaik tantu punyo pamimpin. Misalnyo apobilo kito manjadi pamimpin di Minangkabau tantunyo kito mampunyoi cupak tasandiri dalam diri kito cupak iko nan paratamu tantunyo cupak usali yaitu cupak yang didasarkan pado diri kito maksudnyo hati kito, kama kato hati itulah nan sabananyo.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-min-0101","collection":"dataset/fineweb/min.jsonl","text":"Tahun 2004 satalah Piala Eropa 2004 salasai, Zidane pansiun dari sipak bola internasional, namun katiko Parancih mangalami kasulikan untuak maluluihkan diri ka Piala Dunio 2006, Zidane mangumumkan pado Agustus 2005 bahwa inyo akan kambali bamain di tim nasional. Parancih akhirnyo luluih, tatapi Zidane nan baru malalui musim nan dipanuhi cedera di Madrid, mamutuihkan bahwa inyo akan mundua satalah Piala Dunia tasabuik salasai.\nPado tanggal 25 April 2006, Zizou sacaro rasmi mangumumkan kaputuihannyo untuak mundua dari klub jo tim nasional sipak bola Parancih satalah Piala Dunio 2006.\nPado tanggal 7 Mei 2006 Zizou mamainkan patandiangan tarakhir sabagai tuan rumah untuak Real Madrid di Stadion Santiago Bernabéu. Pamain Real Madrid mamakai baju kaus khusuo nan batando \"ZIDANE 2001 - 2006\" tatulih di bawah logo klub. Mode nan dapek didugo, pandukuang Real Madrid maagiah inyo sambuikan nan hangek jo mandukuang Zizou sapanjang patandiangan.","token_ids":[1084,87862,1032,1050,1048,1048,1052,1265,4339,1816,120664,101310,1032,1050,1048,1048,1052,97076,2464,1044,2163,1327,2868,76913,1105,1384,10073,50682,1489,40849,87915,2957,1044,89082,13681,8003,3286,2141,4183,18732,1279,7345,14852,1366,7842,8471,42413,4773,10799,1104,4537,64699,8614,120664,23916,1655,1032,1050,1048,1048,1054,1044,2163,1327,2868,18732,91572,1274,2039,107381,1032,1050,1048,1048,1053,28090,1294,13504,24634,1409,2589,4077,1289,1325,1493,1772,6832,123451,1046,3286,2141,4183,45393,3491,1111,1295,10799,1104,1044,51941,5400,2163,1327,2868,11576,44001,4773,52630,60748,11576,15018,1271,112473,44106,2901,1772,14288,1044,42881,1341,2386,1104,4537,28090,1294,13504,24634,35039,4037,1265,4339,1816,120664,91403,26617,76029,1552,97076,2464,1626,1080,2039,56284,1032,1050,1053,5821,1032,1050,1048,1048,1054,1044,2163,87410,8649,9234,125342,18732,91572,11553,1341,2386,1104,1980,13504,8471,42413,35039,4037,10073,23365,5552,6832,123451,50682,1489,40849,3286,2141,4183,1265,4339,1816,120664,23916,1655,1032,1050,1048,1048,1054,1626,1080,2039,56284,1032,1055,47163,1032,1050,1048,1048,1054,2163,87410,42881,119155,2350,41957,11413,16633,62345,11045,12448,4487,1271,64152,8471,42413,11690,14288,1772,23229,23569,10518,1401,99293,1046,36366,1493,11690,14288,42881,121043,1289,15650,1409,1979,4640,30226,1111,11576,8724,2574,1429,1090,3084,5010,1069,1032,1050,1048,1048,1049,1462,1032,1050,1048,1048,1054,1034,51941,1366,4183,1772,55939,20909,23365,1046,36015,11576,2170,49134,2697,19