context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-mt-0024","collection":"dataset/fineweb/mt.jsonl","text":"Ta’ għoxrin sena s-surmast Muscat Azzopardi laħaq surmast direttur tal-banda ta’ l-Istitut ta’ San Ġużepp tal-Ħamrun. Fis-sena 1928, wara li ngħata bidu għat-twaqqif tal-banda San Ġużepp fi ħdan l-istitut ta’ San Ġuzepp f’Għajnsielem, is-surmast Anton Muscat Azzopardi, avviċinat minn Mons. Ġużeppi De Piro, aċċetta sabiex jgħallem il-mużika lit-tfal ta’ l-Orfanatrofju f’ Għawdex.\nBarra li kien għalliem tal-mużika kien ukoll għalliem tal-vuċi.\nHuwa għallem fl-iskola ta’ l-Imdina kif ukoll fil-Liċeo. Muscat Azzopardi, barra li kien ukoll surmast direttur ta’ diversi baned oħra Maltin, fosthom, il-banda Stella Maris Band Club ta’ tas-Sliema, li tagħha wkoll dan surmast direttur minn Marzu tas-sena 1938 sa’ l-1944.","token_ids":[51386,1471,1343,1196,1167,3155,15306,1265,3414,1265,19569,1109,1642,5390,12338,8170,1122,1484,27724,1427,1196,1167,56014,1958,1109,1642,58486,1328,7090,2756,6665,7535,1471,1295,20101,37593,7535,1471,5151,1943,1160,1117,10745,1695,7090,1045,1196,1166,1325,16353,1046,1439,1275,2553,3414,1032,1049,1057,1050,1056,1044,2771,1097,3889,4684,1196,1167,1633,22185,1117,1343,1196,1167,1269,2848,4761,40919,1391,7090,2756,6665,5151,1943,1160,1117,10745,1695,10112,1943,1167,18743,1295,1045,1416,1276,1341,7535,1471,5151,1943,1160,69353,1695,1284,1471,1071,1196,1167,2146,10105,1386,5301,1044,1395,19569,1109,1642,21399,5390,12338,8170,1122,1484,27724,1044,2078,2719,1196,1139,79663,2365,1110,65195,1046,1943,1160,1117,10745,59018,2491,1390,4921,1044,1261,1196,1139,1196,1139,18955,11045,1386,1120,1475,1103,1196,1167,1279,5301,2101,3049,1117,3562,4822,12283,2848,40921,7535,1471,1295,72309,46468,10034,1102,5517,1284,1471,1461,1196,1167,3026,3068,1626,8168,1357,3889,1409,1997,1343,1196,1167,1599,5108,7090,3049,1117,3562,4822,1409,1997,18142,1932,1343,1196,1167,1599,5108,7090,9332,1117,1196,1139,1105,1626,68667,4761,1343,1196,1167,