,"om","ala"," z","inth","u"," zap","am","w","amba"," kom","ans","o"," nt","ch","ito"," zab","w","ino"," kw","amb","iri",","," nd","ik","up","ang","its","a"," Zheng","ch","eng"," kuk","ula"," bw","ino","."],"ids_available":true,"boundaries_approximate":false,"piece_format":"native_vocabulary_piece","decoded_text":"Chokhumba chathu\nLolani Zhengcheng apite kudziko lapansi, dziko lidziwe Zhengcheng.\nMfundo yamakampani\nMgwirizano wokhazikika, wopambana-wopambana.\nLingaliro lautumiki\nPezani ulemu wamakasitomala ndi chidziwitso chaukadaulo komanso malingaliro antchito\nUdindo wa anthu\nNdi udindo wa kampani iliyonse kukhala ndi udindo pa chikhalidwe cha anthu.M'zaka zisanu ndi ziwiri zapitazi, Zhengcheng wakhala akutsatira filosofi yokhudzana ndi anthu komanso kuteteza chilengedwe.\nKwa ogwira ntchito\nLolani wogwira ntchito aliyense akhale ndi chidwi komanso kuchita bwino\nKugwira ntchito molimbika kwa membala aliyense wabanja la Zhengcheng kwathandizira kuti Zhengcheng achite bwino kwambiri masiku ano.Achibale amalemekezana, amaphunzira kuchokera kwa wina ndi mzake, amakula wina ndi mzake, amapita patsogolo pamodzi, ndipo nthawi zonse amalowetsa mphamvu zatsopano ku Zhengcheng.Ndimalo ogwirizana kotero kuti titha kupatsa makasitomala zinthu zapamwamba komanso ntchito zabwino kwambiri, ndikupangitsa Zhengcheng kukula bwino.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-oc-0057","collection":"dataset/fineweb/oc.jsonl","text":"La clau del bobsleigh es, normalament, a la partença. Lo primièrs mètres son decisius pels passatgièr que devon aténher la màger velocitat possibla donada a la lisa, per aquò cal que los participants sián massisses e, mai, rapids. Las diferéncias entre los participants es tant prima que ven gaireben impossible de recuperar quitament una error pichona. Malgrat que la lisa dispause d'un fren, aqueste s'utilisa unicament un còp passada la linha d'arribada. Las velocitats passan sovent los 150 km per ora e los correires supòrtan de fòrças de fins a 4 o 5 G.\nLas espròvas se disputan en doas margues, en addicionant los tempses atenguts dins ambedoas, e ganha aquel que totalitza lo temps mendre. En cas d'egalizacion, causa pauc infreqüenta, se parteja la medalha.\nMalgrat que la seguretat foguèt melhorat fòrça los darrièrs ans, e malgrat que los participants son equipats amb de cascos e vestits especials, se produguèt d'accidents al sortir dins una corba, essent un espòrt fòrça perilhós.","token_ids":[3453,1573,1786,1807,1289,34884,70972,1823,1044,5270,3126,1044,1261,1427,1805,29245,1046,10689,49613,1754,7311,25408,2376,2885,6364,1374,51269,2764,1269,6216,1754,1114,1613,2919,1263,1513,2747,1900,1427,20817,2462,11416,11890,2991,1612,2584,2607,2045,1261,1427,1295,7795,1044,1651,8726,3422,2615,1613,2125,9803,2445,2855,5543,35869,1324,1044,7538,1044,5394,4807,1046,10670,10196,2747,15897,3527,2125,9803,1823,12537,12529,1613,6796,105245,3554,16501,1311,64562,31306,3126,2331,3880,1274,1521,4504,1046,6000,83163,1613,1427,1295,7795,8671,2504,1266,4783,60695,1044,19413,1101,1265,31212,7795,82155,3126,1457,105549,1112,2764,2045,1427,52836,1266,23458,8376,2045,1046,10670,11416,40450,2764,1271,18375,1297,2125,1032,1049,1053,1048,4661,1651,30574,1324,2125,13100,4235,2842,3422,5185,1271,1311,1284,3422,1114,19550,1311,21906,1261,1032,1052,1281,1032,1053,1461,1626,19849,1823,1553,3422,7797,1412,12282,1271,1418,1653,1288,16269,2403,1044,1418,2229,18419,1450,2125,8408,1264,1513,2031,14694,73259,1855,3507,1111,1288,1044,1324,10020,3230,35585,1613,3788,18638,1990,8408,1283,7660,1046,2788,3035,1266,1039,56712,1518,13281,1044,17725,1274,10758,3857,9363,1671,7379,1044,1412,5600,2922,1427,25014,3230,1626,29523,83163,1613,1427,3939,1549,16169,24976,1117,24700,30828,1269,1284,3422,1114,5513,2125,6120,1444,1754,7311,5571,1044,1324,4773,83163,1613,2125,9803,2376,8955,2476,4831,1311,3035,6907,1324,15327,2383,13154,1115,1044,1412,2309,3394,24700,1266,21280,17938,1410,37671,73259,2331,2281,4402,