eahttái vuodjit jus galggan hárjehallat, dán háve in leat ollen go oktii doppe fitnat, muitala son.\nIi sáhte beare rámbuvrras viežžalit\nLänsman vuoddjá Polaris Pro RMK 800 skohteriin. Son vujii ovdal Lynx, muhto lonuhii Polarisii moadde jagi dassái. Son lea aitto bijahan skohterii ođđa olggoža, sabehiid ja muđui ordnen skohtera nu ahte lea gilvogearggus. Dat lea gal vel nu ahte dakkár skohtera ii sáhte beare mannat viežžalit rámbuvrras.\n– Dakkár čáhcecrossaskohtera ii sáhte beare mannat rámbuvrras oastit, lea olu maid šaddá dahkat nu ahte dat šaddá buorre čázis. Dasa manná olu áigi ja ferte maid máhttu leat dasa. Polaris lea goit hui geahpas vuodjit, dan lea álki hállet ja muđui doaibmá maid hui bures, muitala son.","token_ids":[68032,121305,2376,1459,1097,3195,15493,101717,1502,1804,1097,2381,2132,1378,1044,1311,3593,1324,2464,1459,1269,1310,5728,2548,60600,1271,1672,1106,5191,2381,22786,1111,8998,1269,1046,1436,2464,1974,1276,6828,2867,1288,1044,2376,6690,2603,1502,11216,10013,1336,2867,1816,1276,3044,2523,19735,14421,1552,22944,1106,1502,54733,1502,1626,1882,1443,5728,2548,60600,1269,11216,16987,1884,2381,14777,97803,4743,6690,2603,1271,1044,1974,1266,9907,1446,6828,2867,1288,43375,1402,8528,1310,5728,2548,60600,1269,1046,22115,23553,2154,6690,2603,1269,23235,2083,2182,1097,2521,15293,10013,1387,1106,1276,1475,1374,11216,1103,2418,1310,5728,2548,60600,1269,1044,1266,2855,17452,1672,1294,1459,1269,49706,1262,1974,97803,4743,8592,1446,8125,12876,1044,3849,3235,1097,2376,1626,1073,1105,1265,1502,22173,1402,1667,83827,3991,27124,4011,7262,2546,2546,1279,1276,1010,1076,59114,2703,10013,29962,1106,1502,4010,27215,2451,46073,1075,1032,1056,1048,1048,3044,2523,1397,47475,1046,8558,1330,7657,4743,11452,24857,25283,1120,1044,3849,108148,43307,6786,4743,4010,27215,4743,3498,1332,1558,1475,14114,5462,15293,1046,8558,1459,1097,30714,1611,12134,16034,3044,2523,1397,4743,1281,8998,85518,4408,1103,2762,53991,1044,37675,8101,1327,4042,3849,8998,2386,6508,5364,3044,2523,19735,6