i lo se isi lava malo, o loo matua pagatia i faiga faatiga uiga ese; e faitau afe ma afe ua leai ni galuega-ua fia ‘a’ai tamaiti ma lafoa’ina -ma ua tafefea atu i totonu o le olaga o le toatele.\nO le Vaega a le Leipa –lea sa taitaina e Michael Joseph Savage-e foliga mai o loo maua mai ai sina faamoemoe- ma i taimi faai’u o le 1935 ma le Faigamalo muamua a Leipa-na filifilia e pulea le Malo, ma o le tagata o le Leipa sa finau mo le Mau-o Harry Holland -na maliu i le 1933, ma o i latou na filifia i ia tulaga i totonu o le faigamalo fou-sa matua le malamalama lava i se mea e tatau ona fai i totonu o Samoa.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-sn-0073","collection":"dataset/fineweb/sn.jsonl","text":"Zvidyo zveKorea zvinogona kutaurwa senge: yakabikwa Tokbokki, yegungwa udon noodles, inonhuwirira huku ine chizi, mupunga rolls, …\nKunze kwezvo, Mwedzi Kukurumidza Kudya kunopawo spaghetti yemombe yakabikwa. Nezvakanakira zviri pamusoro, iyo resitorendi inokwezva vazhinji vanodya kuti vanakirwe, kunyanya vadzidzi. Ndosaka kazhinji pasina tafura, paunouya kuzodya panguva dzepamusoro, unogona kumirira maminetsi makumi maviri kusvika makumi matatu kune tafura uye kurongeka zvakare kwakarebesa. Nguva yepamusoro yechitoro kazhinji inenge 5 kusvika 6 pm. Kana iwe uchida kunakidzwa nechikafu paMwedzi Fast Food, iwe unofanirwa kuuya nekukurumidza.","token_ids":[1090,21685,13504,117793,1075,32792,1554,7470,1500,4504,1409,7734,1328,4761,6572,1643,1058,31411,1401,1552,4761,16377,1098,1662,3757,1044,1404,2055,1851,4761,10519,1263,96572,2013,1044,1294,1263,17279,30742,4222,1310,28458,32451,1528,14412,1044,1283,1982,61238,57958,1044,107577,1075,1384,2343,1409,1808,1122,2518,1044,1373,31111,4606,85504,1328,1403,1327,2712,111352,4263,10176,26446,2054,1942,1393,97372,1404,1356,76451,31411,1401,1552,4761,1046,4671,38974,8821,1489,4222,43559,11667,33816,1374,7402,1044,1623,13504,1610,3604,18005,1294,1662,1808,1122,2940,48947,17385,52