a i ta outou haapiiraa utuafare?","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-ty-0046","collection":"dataset/fineweb/ty.jsonl","text":"14. E nafea Iehova e tauturu ai ia oe ia tiavaruhia hoê melo o te utuafare?\n14 A feruri na i te tahi atu tupuraa fifi. Peneia‘e ua tiavaruhia hoê melo o to oe utuafare. Ua ite oe eaha ta te Bibilia e parau ra no nia i te feia tei tiavaruhia. (Kor. 1, 5:11; Ioa. 2, 10) No to oe here i tera taata, e mana‘o paha oe e mea fifi mau ia auraro i te faaueraa Bibilia aore ra eita roa ’tu e nehenehe. E tiaturi anei oe e e horoa mai to oe Metua i te ra‘i i te puai no te auraro ia ’na ma te taiva ore? E mana‘o anei oe e ua riro teie tupuraa ei taime no te haafatata ’tu ia Iehova?\n15. No te aha Adamu i faaroo ore ai ia Iehova?\n15 E faaau ana‘e te reira i ta te taata matamua ra o Adamu i rave. Ua tiaturi anei oia e e nehenehe oia e faaroo ore ia Iehova e e ora noa? Aita, “e ere hoi Adamu tei vare.” (Tim. 1, 2:14) No te aha ïa oia i faaroo ore ai ia Iehova? Ua amu Adamu i te maa hotu ta ta ’na vahine i horoa ’tu no te mea ua here rahi a‘e oia i ta ’na vahine i ia Iehova.","token_ids":[1049,1052,1046,1436,2336,3070,1097,1362,12687,7187,1324,81063,20836,10160,20666,1281,1101,20666,9650,108453,6786,1485,4744,2114,7731,1111,1281,1777,5149,1117,4032,1667,9551,1049,1052,1349,7254,8874,2336,1623,1777,12914,1105,100172,1257,1982,3099,1097,1284,10139,1046,1390,2509,1485,6702,1101,1333,1097,9650,108453,6786,1485,4744,2114,7731,1111,1281,1317,1281,1101,5149,1117,4032,1667,1046,1608,1097,1494,1101,1281,1101,1324,13090,7535,1777,1398,8258,1485,1324,1635,1786,2093,1836,1308,1485,1623,1777,2337,1485,1777,1105,9650,108453,6786,1485,1046,1319,1075,1270,1046,1032,1049,1044,1032,1053,1058,1049,1049,1059,1362,19374,1046,1032,1050,1044,1032,1049,1048,1041,3501,1317,1281,1101,3226,1623,2733,1097,7535,1633,1044,1324,43650,6702,1111,1274,13090,1281,1101,1324,1639,1097,1284,10139,41200,20666,12667,9234,1623,1777,3456,17