loo yàggal mbir yi. Ñoom, waa BBY, amal nañuy ndaje yu bare yoy, Njiitu réew mi ci boppam moo leen tëggoon. Lépp rekk ngir diisoo ak ñoom, xirtal leen ci ñu topp ci ginnaaw kim nar a tànn. Waaye loolu de, ay gént kese lay ndiru.","token_ids":[1087,1097,36873,3572,1117,5622,2753,1404,1105,106987,2867,1261,1504,13775,1032,1053,1101,35984,1464,5297,3111,2816,2032,1403,8392,13987,1279,3498,1313,1044,17015,2336,2624,1117,1990,1336,1626,4551,1311,1101,6294,87245,2548,5229,1044,19879,11667,7770,105145,8558,3505,1344,13775,1261,1295,2631,104877,1403,2460,1299,1404,1105,1046,1488,2631,1978,1275,1308,5297,27621,88057,1102,3889,1044,1492,1177,2509,1262,1492,1177,1337,1695,58237,2336,2624,5753,1623,23940,77171,1737,2628,1279,36634,1335,1921,1763,1044,19618,1328,1816,105145,14198,3676,1044,8834,32621,2179,8528,1271,1335,1921,1763,1044,50890,1368,16997,1279,1044,5682,1279,1351,1461,1921,1107,4106,1044,45993,1115,1046,5258,1311,1101,8411,1097,7492,2649,1111,129457,1107,31716,10100,1277,3498,1313,1044,6294,17019,3026,1936,40282,1763,2631,1103,1343,4743,1427,1373,10004,1335,1921,1763,2771,1261,1284,1924,1279,8518,3849,1257,9926,1110,1626,39903,1378,7492,2649,1111,129457,1107,31716,10100,1277,1044,1492,1177,1117,17015,1492,1177,12078,54143,1289,28174,1317,1500,1523,1464,5297,3111,2816,2032,3667,1046,1492,1145,1105,6294,1343,18493,1261,1284,1924,1492,1177,1111,2340,1349,1325,16970,9350,1044,45565,19618,4182,1097,12965,1110,1044,1349,4077,28755,1464,2922,1417,1044,19618,4427,1417,10058,3026,3190,1507,1921,109232,8839,5682,1325,1398,1506,2340,1507,17498,2054,1046,1492,1145,4743,1492,1177,1337,1695,17233,1044,2513,1492,1177,1117,4625,2649,1392,6035,1404,1276,1044,71127,4106,2624,1117,6957,10100,1277,1046,73356,2753,1044,106883,106987,2867,1366,130549,1121,6035,1887,4298,43431,1044,23940,2753,106883,1285,1506,23198,1119,1366,1887,4298,43431,1046,3377,52424,1044,1990,6150,1111,1404,1921,2867,1279,19879,1378,1404,1105,1046,1492,1145,43431,1044,8411,1097,45299,1089,1044,125243,2336,2624,5739