し、打楽器には手を切らないよう縁を覆った。音程をそろえるために水を足す場面も客に見せ、調整の過程を曲の一部にした。\n\n独特の音に足を止めた買い物客は、配られた木片を打って最後の曲に加わった。音楽経験は問わず、音を出さずに合図を送る役も用意された。\n\nただし、使った物を何でも再利用できるわけではない。安全に演奏できなかった材料は分別し、回収に出す。主催者は楽しさとともに、扱える素材を見極める大切さも知ってほしいと話した。","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"sns-en-0018","collection":"dataset/sns/en.jsonl","text":"Walked past a conference registration screen that displayed the previous visitor's details while waiting for the next person.\n\nI quietly told the organiser. They switched it to a blank confirmation page and checked the rest of the desks.\n\nNo dramatic social post, no photograph of the person's information, no attempt to see how much else the system might reveal. You can report a problem without turning the report into another disclosure.\n\nWhat I liked was the response: “Thank you, we'll fix that now.” Nobody asked why I had noticed or suggested that looking at a public screen was suspicious.\n\nThe team later added a reminder to their setup checklist: test what the screen shows before, during and after a registration, including when someone walks away halfway through.\n\nA surprisingly large part of privacy is what remains on a screen when the task appears to be over. Good catch by the next volunteer too: the confirmation printer had a similar issue. 🖨️","token_ids":[48925,1286,6334,1261,20864,26589,7026,1455,15578,1278,4607,48019,1681,9576,3016,15267,1394,1278,4275,2965,1338,1073,38263,7427,1278,100796,1046,4159,36162,1494,1317,1261,17822,38576,5373,1321,17155,1278,3067,1307,1278,1563,3096,1338,4753,33823,4346,3009,1044,1836,18390,1307,1278,2965,1681,3686,1044,1836,6983,1317,3219,2606,3315,2849,1278,2663,4139,23499,1046,3213,1710,3463,1261,4127,3816,19826,1278,3463,2203,3866,23055,1338,7493,1362,26648,1486,1278,4005,1058,2129,30859,1636,1044,1729,7534,8786,1455,3246,4479,80986,6136,5782,1362,1880,19794,1505,10051,1455,7283,1513,1261,2065,7026,1486,57721,1338,1784,4995,4025,5949,1261,63925,1317,2034,14919,9